<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: emit manawave ritual -->
  <VV_Manawave.label>魔能波动仪式</VV_Manawave.label>
  <!-- EN: Instantly unleashes a massive wave of mana over a wide area, briefly stunning all targets and leaving behind a vast amount of environment mana. The mana wave may also draw the attention of hostile entities nearby. -->
  <VV_Manawave.description>立即投射大量魔能波动覆盖大片区域，这会短暂击晕所有目标并在环境中遗留大量魔能。魔能波动可能引起附近敌对实体的注意。</VV_Manawave.description>
  
</LanguageData>